<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1507) <span class="when">Oct 13, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Panels stay with Asobi.</b> The floating windows (Playlist, Grade, Conform, Pull Plates, Share, Join, the Review Manager and the rest) float over Asobi's own window only while Asobi is the app in front. With another app in front they no longer vanish, and no longer land on top of it: they stay where they are, behind that app's windows, and a panel Asobi opens meanwhile waits there too. Clicking one brings Asobi forward.</li>
<li><b>Joining a review nobody is hosting says so.</b> After a few seconds the Join window reads "Connected — waiting for the host" with the reason, where it said "Connected" and showed nothing. Joining the review this Mac is itself hosting is refused with a word, where it used to stop hosting and leave the review with no host.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
